y. With larger-than-life characters, thrilling twists, and exhilarating triumphs, the story follows a generation of young idealists who rise amid the storms of a troubled age, determined to shape the world around them and pursue their dreams.</p>","updated":1793376150,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/80484"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3790936","name":"Episode 18"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3790937","name":"Episode 19"}}}}},{"id":3784507,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784507/the-great-long-march-1x38-episode-38","name":"Episode 38","season":1,"number":38,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-31","airtime":"20:00","airstamp":"2026-10-31T12:00:00+00:00","runtime":46,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784507"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87677","name":"The Great Long March"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":87677,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/87677/the-great-long-march","name":"The Great Long March","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","War"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":46,"premiered":"2026-10-09","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc00200p1ilkw3.html","schedule":{"time":"20:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":51,"network":{"id":1282,"name":"CCTV-1","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/645/1612878.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/645/1612878.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Revolving around the arduous Long March of the Central Red Army, it documents the historical process—from the army's failure in the fifth counter-encirclement campaign, to the First, Second, Fourth Front Armies of the Red Army and the 25th Red Army launching strategic transfers under the leadership of the CPC Central Committee—to eventual triumph. It extols the unyielding ideals and revolutionary spirit of Mao Zedong and Chinese Communists, and elucidates the history and logic behind the rise and development of the Chinese revolution, proving that adapting Marxism to China's specific conditions was essential for victory.</p>","updated":1793376048,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87677"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784506","name":"Episode 37"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784507","name":"Episode 38"}}}}},{"id":3784508,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784508/the-great-long-march-1x39-episode-39","name":"Episode 39","season":1,"number":39,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-10-31","airtime":"20:00","airstamp":"2026-10-31T12:00:00+00:00","runtime":46,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3784508"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87677","name":"The Great Long March"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":87677,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/87677/the-great-long-march","name":"The Great Long March","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","War"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":46,"premiered":"2026-10-09","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc00200p1ilkw3.html","schedule":{"time":"20:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":51,"network":{"id":1282,"name":"CCTV-1","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Te